trv_unreachable.description:
Easy TRV could not set "{attribute}" on {trv} in {room} after {attempts} attempts. Last error: {error}

Check the thermostat's battery and its Zigbee signal (distance to the nearest router or coordinator). If it still does not respond, re-pair it with ZHA.

This issue resolves itself as soon as a write to the thermostat has been verified.
